Things I know for sure:

- With polymorph (and polymorph control, to make things easier), you
could have changed into something that could fly over the trapdoors or
moat, or a xorn that could walk through the walls.

- If there were enough boulders at the right of the castle level, you
could have plugged up the trapdoors with them.  If you have enough
strength, you could have carried boulder up from the previous level.
Again, with polymorph, you could have become a giant and done this.

Something else I'd try:

- Leave the amulet on the castle level.  Throw it through the central
corridor, over the trapdoors.  Go through a trapdoor and level teleport
up a couple of levels, then come back and retrieve the amulet.

